{
    "title": "Food Lion",
    "description": "The Food Lion online and in-store shopping\u202fyou love, now even better: Sign up for an MVP Card or register your existing one, easier-to-redeem Shop & Earn Rewards and simpler navigation.  \r\n\r\nSo. Many. DEALS.  \r\n* Shop coupons, your local weekly ad, deals and much more right from the app. \r\n* Save it all to your account and automatically redeem in-store or online, when you check out with your MVP Card. \r\n\r\nAnd as always, Food Lion Shop & Earn Rewards are waiting for you no matter how you shop.\u202f \r\n* Sign in to access your Shop & Earn Rewards any time. \r\n* Seamlessly apply Shop & Earn Rewards for grocery savings or donate to charity. \r\n\r\nExperience the Mobile App In-Store, too. \r\n* Sign in to access your MVP Card.  \r\n* Shop & Earn offers apply in-store and online for a seamless earning experience.  \r\n* Scan the digital card in-store for the most savings, and to use your clipped coupons and rewards. \r\n\r\n\r\nYour Food Lion app: Easy, fresh & affordable. You can count on us.",
    "descriptionHTML": "The Food Lion online and in-store shopping\u202fyou love, now even better: Sign up for an MVP Card or register your existing one, easier-to-redeem Shop &amp; Earn Rewards and simpler navigation.  <br><br>So. Many. DEALS.  <br>* Shop coupons, your local weekly ad, deals and much more right from the app. <br>* Save it all to your account and automatically redeem in-store or online, when you check out with your MVP Card. <br><br>And as always, Food Lion Shop &amp; Earn Rewards are waiting for you no matter how you shop.\u202f <br>* Sign in to access your Shop &amp; Earn Rewards any time. <br>* Seamlessly apply Shop &amp; Earn Rewards for grocery savings or donate to charity. <br><br>Experience the Mobile App In-Store, too. <br>* Sign in to access your MVP Card.  <br>* Shop &amp; Earn offers apply in-store and online for a seamless earning experience.  <br>* Scan the digital card in-store for the most savings, and to use your clipped coupons and rewards. <br><br><br>Your Food Lion app: Easy, fresh &amp; affordable. You can count on us.",
